{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"TX230.winproc-tui","latestVersion":"1.8.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"author":"TX230","copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026 TX230 (ft)","description":"A Windows 11 x64 process monitoring TUI for tracking per-process resource usage over time.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"README","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/TX230/winproc-tui/blob/v1.8.0/README.md"},{"DocumentLabel":"Japanese README","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/TX230/winproc-tui/blob/v1.8.0/README.ja.md"}],"license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/TX230/winproc-tui/blob/v1.8.0/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"author":"TX230","copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026 TX230 (ft)","description":"A Windows 11 x64 process monitoring TUI for tracking per-process resource usage over time.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"README","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/TX230/winproc-tui/blob/v1.8.0/README.md"},{"DocumentLabel":"Japanese README","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/TX230/winproc-tui/blob/v1.8.0/README.ja.md"}],"license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/TX230/winproc-tui/blob/v1.8.0/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"winproc-tui is a keyboard-first terminal process monitor for Windows 11 x64. It shows system memory pressure,\nper-adapter GPU activity and memory, CPU, network and disk activity, plus per-process memory, handles,\nGUI resources, GPU, I/O, and .NET metrics. Its investigation workspace provides up to 16 Graphs,\nRaw or MA5 display, exact A/B comparison with range statistics, reusable Investigation Profiles,\nflat and tree process views, recording and saved-log review, and tabbed Process Info for executable details,\nopen files, loaded DLLs, and environment variables.\nTracking includes observed descendant processes. Experimental local MCP integration lets AI assistants\ninvestigate processes, manage Recording, and register Graphs for CSV export.","moniker":"winproc-tui","name":"winproc-tui","packageUrl":"https://github.com/TX230/winproc-tui","publisher":"TX230","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/TX230/winproc-tui/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/TX230","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/TX230/winproc-tui/releases/tag/v1.8.0","tags":["gpu","monitoring","process","ratatui","terminal","tui","windows"]},"ja-JP":{"description":"Windows 11 x64向けのターミナルプロセス監視TUIです。","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"日本語README","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/TX230/winproc-tui/blob/v1.8.0/README.ja.md"}],"locale":"ja-JP","longDescription":"winproc-tui は、キーボード操作を中心に設計された Windows 11 x64 向けのターミナルプロセスモニターです。\nシステム全体のメモリ負荷、GPU アダプター別の負荷とメモリ、CPU、ネットワークとディスクに加え、\nプロセス別のメモリ、ハンドル、GUI リソース、GPU、I/O、.NET メトリクスを表示します。\n最大 16 個の Graph、Raw / MA5 表示、範囲統計を含む正確な A/B 比較、Investigation Profiles、\nフラット / ツリー形式のプロセス表示、記録と保存済みログの確認に対応しています。\nProcess Info では、実行ファイル情報、オープンファイル、ロード済み DLL、環境変数をタブで調査できます。\n検出した子孫プロセスも追跡対象に含めます。実験的なローカル MCP 連携により、AI アシスタントから\nプロセスの調査、記録の操作、グラフの登録と CSV 出力を行えます。","name":"winproc-tui","publisher":"TX230","tags":["GPU","Windows","ターミナル","プロセス","モニタリング"]}},"longDescription":"winproc-tui is a keyboard-first terminal process monitor for Windows 11 x64. It shows system memory pressure,\nper-adapter GPU activity and memory, CPU, network and disk activity, plus per-process memory, handles,\nGUI resources, GPU, I/O, and .NET metrics. Its investigation workspace provides up to 16 Graphs,\nRaw or MA5 display, exact A/B comparison with range statistics, reusable Investigation Profiles,\nflat and tree process views, recording and saved-log review, and tabbed Process Info for executable details,\nopen files, loaded DLLs, and environment variables.\nTracking includes observed descendant processes. Experimental local MCP integration lets AI assistants\ninvestigate processes, manage Recording, and register Graphs for CSV export.","moniker":"winproc-tui","name":"winproc-tui","packageUrl":"https://github.com/TX230/winproc-tui","publisher":"TX230","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.c